// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x00458279 size=37 name=?setPositions@BridgeScaffoldBehavior@@UAEXPBUCoord3D@@00@Z evidence=N:ledger
void BridgeScaffoldBehavior::setPositions(const Coord3D *createPos, const Coord3D *riseToPos, const Coord3D *buildPos)
{
	m_createPos = *createPos;
	m_riseToPos = *riseToPos;
	m_buildPos = *buildPos;
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0045829E size=45 name=?setMotion@BridgeScaffoldBehavior@@UAEXW4ScaffoldTargetMotion@@@Z evidence=N:ledger
void BridgeScaffoldBehavior::setMotion(ScaffoldTargetMotion targetMotion)
{
	m_targetMotion = targetMotion;
	switch (m_targetMotion)
	{
	case STM_RISE:
	case STM_TEAR_DOWN_ACROSS:
		m_targetPos = m_riseToPos;
		break;
	case STM_BUILD_ACROSS:
		m_targetPos = m_buildPos;
		break;
	case STM_SINK:
		m_targetPos = m_createPos;
		break;
	default:
		break;
	}
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004582CB size=40 name=?reverseMotion@BridgeScaffoldBehavior@@UAEXXZ evidence=N:ledger
void BridgeScaffoldBehavior::reverseMotion()
{
	switch (m_targetMotion)
	{
	case STM_STILL:
		setMotion(STM_TEAR_DOWN_ACROSS);
		break;
	case STM_RISE:
		setMotion(STM_SINK);
		break;
	case STM_BUILD_ACROSS:
		setMotion(STM_TEAR_DOWN_ACROSS);
		break;
	case STM_TEAR_DOWN_ACROSS:
		setMotion(STM_BUILD_ACROSS);
		break;
	case STM_SINK:
		setMotion(STM_RISE);
		break;
	}
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004582F3 size=41 name=?getBridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterfaceFromObject@BridgeScaffoldBehavior@@SAPAVBridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterface@@PAVObject@@@Z evidence=N:ledger
BridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterface *BridgeScaffoldBehavior::getBridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterfaceFromObject(Object *object)
{
    if (!object) return 0;
    for (BehaviorModule **module = object->getBehaviorModules(); *module; ++module) {
        BridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterface *scaffold = (*module)->getBridgeScaffoldBehaviorInterface();
        if (scaffold) return scaffold;
    }
    return 0;
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0045831C size=141 name=??0BridgeScaffoldBehavior@@QAE@PAVThing@@PBVModuleData@@@Z evidence=N:ledger
BridgeScaffoldBehavior::BridgeScaffoldBehavior(Thing *thing, const ModuleData *moduleData) :
	UpdateModule(thing, moduleData)
{
	m_targetMotion = STM_STILL;
	m_createPos.zero();
	m_riseToPos.zero();
	m_buildPos.zero();
	m_targetPos.zero();
	m_lateralSpeed = 1.0f;
	m_verticalSpeed = 1.0f;
}


